<title>POLAND: Polish budget gap up to PLN 3.96 bln in Jan-March.</title>
<headline>Polish budget gap up to PLN 3.96 bln in Jan-March.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish budget deficit widened by 2.57 billion to 3.96 billion zlotys in March, which accounted for 32.4 percent of the planned 1997 deficit of 12.22 billion zlotys, the finance ministry said.  </p>
<p> POLISH BUDGET GAP	Jan-March	 Jan-Feb   1997 plan</p>
<p> balance in bln PLN	 3.96		1.39	 12.220</p>
<p> revenue		     23.51	     15.59	115.334</p>
<p> expenditure		 27.47	     16.98	127.554</p>
<p>NOTE: Jan-February figures given as reported last month.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
